Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retain verified local large artifact delivery
 [daveey]

Restore same-executor native delivery without trusting foreign paths; require recorded digest and current delivery policy. Align schema/docs with requested missing-path warnings and document small-file replicated storage. Two local/retained-path regressions fail before repair; add notifier integration coverage.
